<view class="page-shell">
  <app-header title="个人资料" show-back />
  <view class="page-content edit-content">
    <view class="completion-card paper-card">
      <view><text class="serif">资料完善度</text><text class="mono">{{profileCompletion}}%</text></view>
      <view class="completion-track"><view style="width: {{profileCompletion}}%;"></view></view>
      <text>完善头像、昵称和手机号，便于同步会员权益。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title serif">微信资料</view>
    <view class="form-card paper-card">
      <view class="avatar-field">
        <view><text class="field-label">头像</text><text class="field-note">由你主动从微信头像中选择</text></view>
        <button class="avatar-button" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar"><image src="{{profile.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" /></button>
      </view>
      <view class="nickname-field">
        <text class="field-label">昵称</text>
        <input type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="20" placeholder="请输入昵称" bindinput="inputNickname" />
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button save-button" bindtap="saveNickname">保存个人资料</button>

    <view class="section-title serif">账号与联系</view>
    <view class="form-card paper-card">
      <view class="account-row">
        <view><text class="field-label">手机号</text><text class="field-note">{{profile.phoneMasked || (profile.phonePending ? '等待服务端完成绑定' : '未绑定')}}</text></view>
        <button class="outline-button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="getPhoneNumber">{{profile.phoneMasked ? '更换' : '微信授权'}}</button>
      </view>
      <view class="account-row">
        <view><text class="field-label">微信号</text><text class="field-note">微信平台不向小程序开放微信号读取</text></view>
        <text class="readonly-state">不可读取</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-note">
      <text class="serif">隐私说明</text>
      <text>头像和昵称仅在你确认后保存；手机号需经微信授权并由服务端换取。当前预览版不会在本机保存手机号授权码。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
